From 9433facf87119bc2339b72c8b0baf56e94cfa753 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: greyoak111 <151205158+greyoak111@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 17:23:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 37/51] Redo the danmaku overlay as a chat list in a canvas box

The danmaku source now draws a chat list itself (Qt into a texture):
newest message at the bottom, older ones above until the box is full,
names in Bilibili pink, gifts gold, guards purple, Super Chats on a red
strip, long messages wrapped, an optional rounded plate behind the
messages. It redraws only when a message arrives or expires.

Its box works like the captions': OBS's transform controls size it,
and "Position on canvas" places it (bottom left by default). The box
sync / placement and the texture upload are shared modules now
(CanvasBox, OverlayFrame) used by both sources.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
